{"id":112,"chapter_id":0,"scene_id":2,"steps":[{"step":2,"content":"黑暗中，你只能看到眼前的少女。在她冰冷的注视下，嘈杂的乱语爬进你的身体，自顾自地在你脑中碰撞，叫嚣着要撕裂你的灵魂。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":3,"speaker":"S-019","content":"控制<color=#fb9259>它</color>，或是终结于此。","voice":["vo_cgplot_105056"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":4,"speaker":"S-019","content":"你知道该怎么做……","voice":["vo_cgplot_105057"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":5,"speaker":"夜莺","content":"去唤醒它，如果是你，就一定可以驾驭。","voice":["vo_cgplot_105058"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":6,"speaker":"S-019","content":"<color=#fb9259>束缚我</color>，你就是为此存在的。","voice":["vo_cgplot_105059"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":9,"content":"你的手不受控制地动了起来，触碰着少女的脖颈。伴随灼热的疼痛，你的皮肤竟浮现出赤红的纹路。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":10,"content":"那滚烫的纹路蔓延至少女的皮肤，贪婪地向外扩张，划破黑暗，进一步扩散至整个空间。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":11,"speaker":"海拉","content":"不，别过来，不要！！","voice":["vo_cgplot_106003"],"voice_bank":"vo_cgplot_00","style":1,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":12,"content":"海拉的身上同样浮现出纹路，这股莫名的力量也让她无从挣脱。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":13,"content":"而自称S-019的少女仍站在原地，紧盯着你的眼睛。","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1},{"step":14,"content":"只一瞬，你抓住了某种强大的力量，又像窥探到某种深邃的疯狂……","style":3,"background":10000,"log_type":1}]}